-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2-74"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-  mvpnPmsiEntry OBJECT-TYPE
-  SYNTAX        MvpnPmsiEntry
-  MAX-ACCESS    not-accessible
