-  SYNTAX        InetAddressType
-  MAX-ACCESS    read-only
-  STATUS        current
-  DESCRIPTION
-      "The InetAddressType of the mvpnPmsiTunnelPimGroupAddr object
-       that follows.  When the PMSI corresponding to this entry
