-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2-103"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-       The enumerated PMSI types and corresponding
-       descriptions are as follows:
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2-104"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-         intraAsIpmsi : Intra-AS Inclusive PMSI
-         interAsIpmsi : Inter-AS Inclusive PMSI
