-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2-107"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-  mvpnAdvtSent OBJECT-TYPE
-  SYNTAX        Counter32
-  MAX-ACCESS    read-only
-  STATUS        current
-  DESCRIPTION
-      "The number of advertisements successfully
-       sent to the peer PE specified by the corresponding
-       mvpnAdvtPeerAddr.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2-108"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
